 "text": "he forgot to pour the coffee", "timestamp": 1793846151, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "callum_bucha", "author_id": "63755758149", "id": "18129284008920184", "text": "Breaks", "timestamp": 1793829997, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "c1ez_j4yz", "author_id": "7222255326", "id": "18473405752143659", "text": "He forgot about the other trains", "timestamp": 1793820878, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "not.agrawal9", "author_id": "77056723381", "id": "18119445710328731", "text": "He is driving to the coast", "timestamp": 1793815433, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "harveycn1", "author_id": "6877881305", "id": "18505066666099393", "text": "At 120km/h the fuel will last less than 17hrs. If the rail isn't a loop he'll have to stop and change direction. If another train stops he'll crash.", "timestamp": 1793814612, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "bartokbence714", "author_id": "77862463885", "id": "18014924540977460", "text": "He forgot to check if there are infected on board", "timestamp": 1793813883, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "younothim321", "author_id": "43645623633", "id": "18092026562247391", "text": "Fuel is still gonna run out", "timestamp": 1793810657, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "vyx.ive_", "author_id": "59674691493", "id": "18148370515589606", "text": "fuel for 2000 km on 120 km per hour will last for like 17 hours", "timestamp": 1793808416, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "patrik_szabadi", "author_id": "46757310454", "id": "18154598143530064", "text": "He forgot to check for infected, electricity if its an electric", "timestamp": 1793805228, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "igcatzz_", "author_id": "44586410689", "id": "18131771281829447", "text": "What if there is an end to the track?", "timestamp": 1793804252, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "suite_lifeofrellandcinco", "author_id": "44435022574", "id": "18115088306131587", "text": "Have a coffee he gets tired", "timestamp": 1793802991, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfRclimNcex/", "webpage